Package: scx-scheds
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: sched_ext BPF CPU schedulers
 Userspace loaders for sched_ext schedulers: scx_lavd (latency-criticality
 aware, hybrid-CPU aware), scx_bpfland (interactive), scx_flash, scx_cosmos
 and scx_rusty. Requires a kernel with CONFIG_SCHED_CLASS_EXT.
